# Plan-22 customer artifacts — REAL PASSWORD HASHES, NAMES, EMAILS, PHONES.
# extract_wp_customers writes these 0600 and the runbook deletes them after import; this
# is the backstop for the run where somebody extracts into the repo by mistake. The test
# fixtures share the filename and are synthetic, so they are re-included explicitly.
customers-legacy_*.json
!backend/apps/migration_wp/tests/fixtures/customers-legacy_*.json
# Plan-23 order artifacts + the unpaid-transfer chase list: names, emails, phones,
# full postal addresses for 4,096 orders. Same rule, same reason.
orders-legacy_*.json
!backend/apps/migration_wp/tests/fixtures/orders-legacy_*.json
chase-*.csv
